---
title: "syncAllDiscordRoles (stem-system members.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_admin: checkAdmin()
    q_admin --> q_env: apiUrl = env.STEM_BOT_API_URL, token = env.BEARER_TOKEN
    q_env --> q_check_env: apiUrl and token defined?
    q_check_env --> q_err_env: !apiUrl or !token
    q_err_env --> [*]: return error "API URL or Token not configured"
    q_check_env --> q_fetch: both defined
    q_fetch --> q_post: fetch POST /api/roles/sync-all
    q_post --> q_parse: result = res.json()
    q_parse --> q_check_res: res.ok and result.success?
    q_check_res --> q_err_res: !res.ok or !result.success
    q_err_res --> [*]: return error (API error message)
    q_check_res --> q_check_empty: OK
    q_check_empty --> q_no_members: result.message == "No members to sync"
    q_no_members --> [*]: return message "no members to sync"
    q_check_empty --> q_build_msg: members synced
    q_build_msg --> q_format: build message with synced/failed/total counts
    q_format --> [*]: return error = null, message with counts

    note right of q_admin
        INV-001: Requires admin privileges
    end note

    note right of q_post
        INV-002: Batch sync endpoint handles all members server-side
    end note

    note right of q_build_msg
        INV-003: Response includes synced, failed, total counts and optional errors array
    end note
